# Git & IDE
.git
.gitignore
.cursor
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Dependencies (installed inside containers)
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*

# Build outputs
**/dist
**/build
**/.vite
**/.turbo
**/coverage

