**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# OS junk
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Docker data
db_data

# Docs & misc (not needed in images)
**/*.md
!backend/docker/**

# Agent / terminal logs
terminals
